&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a&lt;strong&gt; Contract Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Legal team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Contract Manager&lt;/strong&gt; will serve as a primary day-to-day reviewer and negotiator for procurement agreements, supporting Oklo&#39;s growing contracting needs as the Company scales and builds its first wave of projects. This role will review and negotiate agreements for the procurement of goods and services, manage assigned matters from intake through execution, and provide practical contracting guidance to Procurement, product, engineering, finance, and other business teams. This role reports to our current Contract Manager and works closely with other members of the Legal and Procurement teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review a variety of agreements, with a primary focus on procurement agreements for goods and services, while also supporting SaaS agreements, event agreements, consulting agreements, and related statement of works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement to support the acquisition of goods and services for complex or large-scale development projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify legal and commercial issues, recommend practical solutions, and escalate deviations that fall outside approved playbooks or risk parameters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently triage and prioritize assigned matters and communicate status, open issues, and next steps to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Ironclad to manage assigned matters, approvals, execution, and contract data throughout the contract lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate contract execution and maintain complete and accurate records in Oklo&#39;s contract repository&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply approved templates and playbooks, identify recurring negotiation issues, and recommend practical updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and self-service resources, including guidance on meaningful milestones and requirements in statements of work and task orderss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of contract management or commercial contracting experience, including reviewing and negotiating procurement agreements for goods and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No J.D. required, although relevant experience as a lawyer or non-lawyer is helpful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience reviewing and negotiating agreements for the procurement of goods and services, including support for complex or large-scale development projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and prioritization skills, with the ability to assess legal risk and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of commercial contracting principles across Master Services Agreements, Purchase Orders, Statements of Work, Task Orders, and related procurement agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience and the ability to coordinate cross-functional matters and communicate effectively with different stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Ironclad experience and knowledge of contract lifecycle management best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of legal technology, including appropriate uses of legal AI to support contract review and negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal technology implementation or integration experience, including DocuSign or NetSuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the procurement of goods and services supporting complex construction or hard tech projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Contract Manager who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercises sound contracting judgment and balances legal risk with business objectives within established guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafts, redlines, and negotiates procurement agreements for goods and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works independently within defined authority and recognizes when an issue requires escalation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable bringing order to ambiguity and resolving open-ended contracting issues without unnecessary process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is exceptional at independently triaging and prioritizing work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates legal and commercial issues clearly and gives stakeholders practical options and next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is detail-oriented while working efficiently in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is collaborative with Legal, Procurement, Product, Engineering, Finance, and other business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is willing and able to learn Oklo&#39;s business, contracting positions, and technical context quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is passionate about clean energy and comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $110,000-$150,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Core Design Engineer to join our engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;134&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a53eb3633ea4&quot;&gt;Core Design Engineers at Oklo are responsible for designing performant and manufacturable reactor cores which balance neutronic, thermal hydraulic, material, mechanical, and economic considerations. Work performed by Core Design Engineers includes executing multiphysics simulations to assess core performance, writing clear and thorough design documentation, performing analyses to validate and verify core requirements, and working closely with fabrication engineers to mature their designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;629&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1cb9d90d9087&quot;&gt;Core design is an interdisciplinary field, we are looking for applicants who have a holistic understanding of reactor physics that lets them quickly ascertain how proposed design changes will impact core performance. Level will be determined based on applicant experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0f0873ba2df9&quot;&gt;Traveling to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) 2x per calendar quarter for team meetings, company offsite, or other business gatherings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1081&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c897506cba77&quot;&gt;Translating top-level stakeholder requirements into well-written system functional requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1180&quot; data-local-id=&quot;181a7977e48d&quot;&gt;Modeling core performance over time through multiphysics simulations and first principles approaches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1284&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e67d8fd4b1d&quot;&gt;Documenting work using modern tools and techniques, and producing well-written technical reports&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1384&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0da82fa4d4fd&quot;&gt;Collaborating cross-functionally to define performance requirements, and providing technical feedback to methods development teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1545&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fbc3199e2b99&quot;&gt;Bachelors, Masters, or PhD in nuclear engineering or a related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1617&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7677b3cc119a&quot;&gt;Experience with core design from a multidisciplinary perspective&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1685&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27e954e1e5a8&quot;&gt;Experience with object-oriented programming language (e.g., Python, C++)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1761&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5e9187203582&quot;&gt;Experience with neutronic analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1799&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dab864e2d06d&quot;&gt;Experience with thermal hydraulic analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1845&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3d95f102eb0&quot;&gt;Experience with material analysis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1907&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebc27e54f7f9&quot;&gt;Familiarity with principles of fast reactor core design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1966&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c3890275a776&quot;&gt;Experience with fuel cycle optimization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;13cbd38dcff1&quot;&gt;Familiarity/experience with ternary fuel and ternary fuel cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2077&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b14fef8aa361&quot;&gt;Experience with CI/CD computing environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2125&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8801ea0c5bd3&quot;&gt;Experience with Monte Carlo neutronics tools (e.g., SERPENT, MCNP, SCALE, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2208&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5bd1f7dc489f&quot;&gt;Experience with deterministic neutronics tools (e.g., DIF3D, PERSENT, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2287&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9a7c4c4173c&quot;&gt;Experience with reactor systems codes (e.g., SAS4A/SASSYS-1, SAM, RELAP, TRACE, GOTHIC, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2384&quot; data-local-id=&quot;28bb72113e3b&quot;&gt;Experience with fuel analysis and fuel performance software (e.g., BISON, LIFE-METAL, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2479&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8274b1746461&quot;&gt;Fluency in Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2515&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e6fc27719cd0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Core Design Engineer that is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3f8981b2-1f55-4700-842e-5d45aaf0dfe4&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2569&quot; data-local-id=&quot;79279498dc70&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2603&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9842c9b1922b&quot;&gt;An optimist at heart&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2628&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98f0edbdb6d6&quot;&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d07e26ec5351&quot;&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2719&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f4c713cf2a6&quot;&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2778&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b56ed28d821&quot;&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2847&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7282ec68a50&quot;&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2997&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a1fc57c0f3e1&quot;&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3070&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38ee136c28a5&quot;&gt;An excellent writer who can write in a modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3189&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5779344b8986&quot;&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: $130,000-$190,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a Director of Deployment Strategy and Integration to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo is hiring a Director of Deployment Strategy and Integration to serve as a high-judgment deputy to the Senior Director, Deployments. This senior, independent operator will own top-priority cross-functional deployment workstreams from problem framing and recommendation development through decision and implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deploying advanced nuclear technology requires technical, regulatory, commercial, financial, construction, schedule, operational, customer, and government considerations to move together, often before every fact is known. This leader will bring those inputs into a clear point of view, help senior leaders make consequential choices, and drive aligned teams through execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director will work across business units and functions, earning trust without relying on direct authority over every contributor. Success requires exceptional judgment and writing, comfort with ambiguity, a low-ego operating style, and the discipline to stay with the work until the outcome is real.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own top-priority cross-functional deployment workstreams from problem definition through decision and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter ambiguous situations, identify the underlying question, and build a practical path to an answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop integrated recommendations that connect technical, commercial, regulatory, financial, construction, schedule, operational, customer, and government inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Separate facts, assumptions, constraints, and preferences; test whether the available evidence supports the current plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop options with clear tradeoffs, second-order effects, owners, timing, and a recommended path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convene cross-functional teams, clarify interfaces, surface conflicts, and drive issues to closure or timely escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write concise decision memos, executive updates, meeting narratives, and implementation plans that stand on their own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the Senior Director, Deployments in defined meetings and workstreams and follow through on commitments within that mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert lessons from live projects into practical, repeatable deployment practices for the broader portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 10 or more years of relevant experience; demonstrated scope, judgment, and outcomes matter more than a specific number of years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of independently leading complex, cross-functional work from an ambiguous starting point to a concrete outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and the ability to influence senior leaders and subject-matter experts without relying on reporting authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication in clear, modern, active language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to learn technical and operational subject matter quickly and ask precise questions without overstepping domain expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience carrying decisions into implementation and adapting as facts or conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate with limited direction and represent a senior leader credibly within a defined mandate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex programs, deployments, infrastructure development, strategy and operations, technical special projects, government programs, or high-stakes field operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in advanced energy, nuclear, aerospace, defense technology, construction, industrial systems, autonomy, or another regulated hardware environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with first-of-a-kind delivery, government customers or partners, complex contracts, project finance, capital decisions, stage gates, project controls, EPC partners, commissioning, or operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct field, site, construction, manufacturing, or customer-deployment experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Deployment Strategy and Integration Director that is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong problem framer:&lt;/strong&gt; Identifies the real decision, relevant time horizon, constraints, and downstream consequences before proposing a solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An independent decision-maker:&lt;/strong&gt; Forms and defends a sound view with incomplete or conflicting information while being clear about uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An exceptional writer:&lt;/strong&gt; Turns a large, messy source set into a short document that an executive can use to decide and a team can use to act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A systems thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; Connects engineering, regulatory, commercial, finance, construction, schedule, operations, customer, and government realities without losing the critical path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A decisive collaborator:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds alignment across teams while keeping decision ownership clear and using escalation thoughtfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An execution-minded strategist:&lt;/strong&gt; Converts recommendations into owners, sequence, resources, risks, and review points, and stays engaged through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to work on a dynamic team, receive constructive feedback, and grow with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving, while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters in Santa Clara, California twice a quarter, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters. Travel is expected to be approximately 50% and may be higher during critical deployment periods, including travel to project sites and external stakeholder meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $170,000-$220,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
