&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a Facilities Electrician to join our facilities and operations team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Facilities Electrician maintains, improves, and brings online the electrical infrastructure that supports Oklo&#39;s industrial, manufacturing, and project facilities. This role applies electrical fundamentals to high-voltage distribution, motor controls, circuits, the National Electrical Code, California Electrical Safety Orders, and Cal/OSHA requirements. Working independently with general supervision and in close collaboration with cross-functional teams, this person performs troubleshooting, corrective repairs, upgrades, new installations, and preventive maintenance. The role will be deployed to various Oklo sites to help bring equipment, building systems, and facilities online and will travel to sites as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform skilled electrical work associated with construction, maintenance, installation, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete skilled electrical and mechanical work related to the distribution and transmission of electrical power.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to prepare for, install, commission, and bring newly purchased production and facility equipment online.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy to various Oklo project and operating sites to support facility startup, equipment energization, commissioning, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with 480-volt and 208-volt single-phase and three-phase electrical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rough in and terminate single-phase and three-phase panels, including bending and installing electrical metallic tubing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain building electrical systems, lighting, compressed-air systems, and heating, ventilation, and air-conditioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply Occupational Safety and Health Administration regulations and established safety practices while performing work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct daily and weekly facility inspections to monitor general operations, safety, and building conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely operate hand and power tools, including drills, saws, grinders, and sanders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform work across multiple maintenance trades, including carpentry, electrical work, plumbing, painting, and lighting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to Oklo sites as project schedules, commissioning activities, maintenance needs, and business priorities require.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least two years of electrical experience in an industrial or manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent General Educational Development credential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership of assigned tasks with general supervision, organize workloads effectively, manage competing priorities, and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving abilities, a proactive approach, and the ability to anticipate next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to continuously learn and develop new skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret blueprints and electrical diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform arithmetic calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification or demonstrated ability to safely operate scissor lifts, boom lifts, forklifts, and pallet jacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possession of a valid California Class C driver&#39;s license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of environmental and workplace safety practices and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain accurate and detailed written and electronic documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical ability to walk or stand for extended periods and to bend, stoop, reach, carry, crawl, climb, and lift as required to perform assigned duties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel to, work at, and support multiple Oklo sites as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting equipment commissioning, facility startup, or operational readiness activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple maintenance trades in industrial or manufacturing facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mobilizing between project sites and adapting to changing field priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Facilities Electrician who demonstrates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An optimist at heart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent writer who can write in a modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honesty:&lt;/strong&gt; We promote a safe working environment in which transparent and honest communication is a standard business practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A positive attitude:&lt;/strong&gt; Success begins with the right mindset. A constructive attitude supports individual performance, coworkers, and Oklo&#39;s broader mission.&lt;/li&gt;
