&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for a Project Engineer to join our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;496&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6081bd51-0437-4693-87fa-e019b3c28984&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Project Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;on Oklo’s fuel fabrication team, you’ll be responsible for supporting multidisciplinary nuclear design, licensing, procurement, and construction activities by coordinating project schedules, initiating nuclear-grade purchasing, and ensuring clear task tracking across multiple facility deployments for all team members. This role plays a critical part in maintaining nuclear safety, regulatory compliance, and disciplined project execution. The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, technically capable, and well-versed in the rigor required in nuclear environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1085&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d97bb2e8-2c23-40d3-84ae-03c04be748ac&quot;&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role where technical excellence and a collaborative mindset are equally valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1244&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain integrated schedules for nuclear system design, equipment qualification, procurement, and construction activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1383&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Incorporate regulatory milestones, QA/QC steps, readiness reviews, and hold points into project timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1493&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Track progress across engineering disciplines (mechanical, electrical, I&amp;amp;C, safety analysis, licensing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1601&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Identify schedule risks, critical-path items, and long-lead nuclear components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1684&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Lead recurring project coordination meetings, ensuring alignment between engineering, licensing, procurement, and construction teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1821&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952f5f8e-2f8d-4f80-b638-1c38df4a842b&quot;&gt;Prepare status reports for internal leadership and regulators (as applicable).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1903&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0767e1af-6fcc-46df-ac8d-62a0a6764108&quot;&gt;Generate procurement documentation for safety-related, ASME-coded, and nuclear-grade equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2002&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ac3c498d-e721-4e68-8191-464f807fa6fe&quot;&gt;Manage RFQs, vendor communications, and verification of technical and quality requirements (e.g., material certs, CMTRs, FATs, documentation packages).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;41de89c3-19a1-42ee-8f72-bdabb818563f&quot;&gt;Track lead times, manufacturing progress, inspections, and delivery schedules of critical nuclear components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2270&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cb736ed6-3fff-475f-bc73-3013c89729e1&quot;&gt;Work closely with supply chain quality, engineering, and project managers to ensure compliance with nuclear procurement processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ec615b64-e049-4e88-bfa0-060887637d67&quot;&gt;Maintain detailed engineering task lists, design action logs, and configuration-controlled revision tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
