&lt;p&gt;We are excited to announce an open call for talented interns to join Oklo&#39;s dynamic team! Below are multiple positions across various disciplines that may be available, offering the chance to work on innovative projects for Summer 2027. If you&#39;re passionate about solving complex challenges, thrive in a collaborative environment, and are eager to contribute to groundbreaking solutions, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo interns are required to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocate or be available to work out of Santa Clara CA where Oklo Headquarters is located for the duration of the internship or out of one of our satellite locations in Denver, CO, Brooklyn, NY, Idaho Falls, ID, or Washington D.C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be available to work&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;30-40 hours per week between June 7, 2027 - August 20, 2027&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(depending on the scope of work)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be currently enrolled or recently (2027) graduated with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s Degree from an accredited university&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intern Position Descriptions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thermal Hydraulics Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The TH Intern will develop intermediate fidelity (IF) subchannel and high-fidelity computational fluid dynamics (CFD) models for applications in sodium fast reactors (SFRs). The project will involve comparisons between simulation results and experimental data. The exact topic will depend on interest and company needs but could cover fluid-structure interaction, turbulence model development, uncertainty quantification, or surrogate modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;ordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;ordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coursework in fluid mechanics and heat transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;General reactor physics and systems analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Statistical methods and uncertainty quantification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with 3-D CFD and meshing workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__ordered p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;ordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with advanced 3-D CFD concepts (large eddy simulation, fluid-structure interaction)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with high-performance computing workflows and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with MOOSE framework (SAS, RELAP, MOOSE subchannel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience with legacy codes in FORTRAN or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;2&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with statistics and reduced order modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Materials Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with members of Oklo’s Materials Team, will help with the selection and qualification of materials for use in nuclear reactor systems. Typical work duties include computational model development and implementation, engineering analysis, documentation, and interfacing with our fuel fabrication and engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing material performance across expected operating conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new analysis methods to predict material behavior in service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing engineering analyses, including assessments of thermal performance, mechanical performance, safety performance, manufacturability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating cross-functionally to provide technical feedback to quick-iterating computational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authoring technical reports using modern documentation tools and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Required &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and developing material behavior models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with material characterization (material testing, metallography)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Background in nuclear,&amp;nbsp;chemical, materials engineering, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Motivated learner who is adept at efficiently summarizing literature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with engineering simulation software, such as ANSYS or COMSOL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding or data analysis experience (e.g., Python or similar tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Analyst Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This intern will contribute to the evaluation and optimization of mechanical components that are critical to Oklo’s advanced power plant designs. This position offers hands-on experience in applying engineering fundamentals, performing structural analysis, and integrating results into design iterations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply first-principles mechanics and strength of materials to support analysis of structural components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in summarizing mechanical analysis results for design teams, highlighting key findings such as peak stresses, margins of safety, and potential design revisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of technical documentation, ensuring clear and concise communication of assumptions, methods, and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design, manufacturing, and testing teams to help inform design improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Required &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Working toward a degree in Mechanical Engineering, Aerospace Engineering, Materials Science, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong foundation in mechanics of materials, dynamics, and heat transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Exposure to FEA tools (e.g., Ansys, Abaqus, COMSOL, or similar) through coursework or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python, MATLAB, or another programming language for basic data analysis or workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to clearly document and present technical findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Prior research or project experience involving creep, fatigue, or thermal-mechanical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with engineering codes and standards (e.g., ASME, AISC, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience using Git or another version control system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instrumentation and Controls Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This intern will contribute to the development, integration, and testing of measurement and control systems that support advanced reactor operation and power generation. This position provides hands-on exposure to sensors, automation, and control strategies, while giving interns the opportunity to apply classroom knowledge to real-world engineering challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in developing and testing sensors, instrumentation, and actuators under real design constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and implement control algorithms for equipment and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the integration of I&amp;amp;C components into reactor systems and analysis workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting methods, results, and system designs in a clear and professional manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design and analysis teams to provide feedback that supports rapid iteration and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Required &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working toward a degree in Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Computer Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with measurement techniques, data acquisition, and signal processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to control theory and feedback systems through coursework or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic programming skills in Python (or similar) for data analysis and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and an eagerness to learn in a collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with circuit design (analog or digital) from labs, research, or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to communication protocols and digital networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git version control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Neutronics Methodologies Intern&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This intern will assist in updating and streamlining neutronic methodologies to align with the latest format and standards. They will ensure that the methodologies match the way the code base builds the model, verifying consistency across both. This position also involves identifying and documenting gaps or discrepancies in the review process for future improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update and optimize neutronic methodologies to the latest format and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure methodologies align with the way the code base builds the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and document any gaps or discrepancies in the current processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with team members to ensure consistency and accuracy in modeling procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python for scripting and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with AsciiDoc for documentation and formatting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in nuclear engineering and neutronics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail with an ability to identify gaps in methodologies and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Process Intern&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This intern will support the design and analysis of fluid and power systems that are essential to Oklo’s advanced reactors. This position provides hands-on experience with system modeling, equipment evaluation, and prototyping, offering interns a chance to apply classroom knowledge to real-world energy systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in designing fluid and process systems, including piping, valves, pumps, compressors, and heat exchangers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support definition of process equipment specifications, performance criteria, and operating conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to prototype setup and testing activities for iterative system design and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help prepare technical documentation to support system layout, fabrication, installation, and operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers on analyses to evaluate performance and inform design refinements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document results and methods in a clear and professional manner for use across design and regulatory teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Required &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working toward a bachelor’s or master’s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Chemical Engineering, Nuclear Engineering, or a related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, and heat transfer through coursework or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with process or system modeling tools (e.g., MATLAB, Python, Aspen, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to clearly communicate technical findings through reports or presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lab work, prototyping, or experimental systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to piping and instrumentation diagrams (P&amp;amp;IDs) or process design coursework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with pumps, heat exchangers, or thermal-fluid systems from research or internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototyping/Manufacturing Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The prototyping engineering intern will be a part of the prototyping and visualization team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in machining and general fabrication of prototypes and test setups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers to develop and execute testing procedures for mechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support assembly, troubleshooting, and optimization of electro-mechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct inspections and quality control on fabricated components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document test results, process improvements, and technical findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the engineering team to improve designs and manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a safe and organized workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechanical, manufacturing, electrical, nuclear, chemical, or similar engineering student graduating with bachelors, masters, or PhD within the following year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with mechanical fabrication, machining, or assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of mechanical design, materials, and manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with mechanical measurement tools (calipers, micrometers, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret engineering drawings and schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work independently and in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and technical documentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with manual or CNC machining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to electronics, sensors, and control systems (mechatronics experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CAD software (SolidWorks, AutoCAD, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with welding, 3D printing, or other prototyping techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of fluid mechanics, thermodynamics, or materials science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data acquisition systems and programming (Python, LabVIEW, or MATLAB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Operations Intern&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role provides an opportunity to gain hands-on experience in business operations, process improvement, and cross-functional collaboration. This role is ideal for someone looking to grow their operational skill set in core business operational functions and is passionate about contributing to initiatives that drive efficiency while supporting key compliance functions across the organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;773&quot;&gt;Assist with day-to-day business operations, including process documentation, workflow optimization, and project coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;773&quot;&gt;Collect, organize, and analyze operational and financial data to generate insights and support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;Prepare reports, presentations, and dashboards for internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;968&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (finance, HR, marketing, product, etc.) to support operational initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Conduct research on industry trends, competitors, and best practices to support strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1283&quot;&gt;Identify and recommend opportunities for process improvements and increased efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Provide administrative and logistical support for team projects and meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Required &lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1393&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Currently pursuing a bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Operations Management, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1585&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite (Excel, PowerPoint, Word) or Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Attention to detail and eagerness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for interns that are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to work on a dynamic team, receive constructive feedback, and grow with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving, while not leaning only on what has been done before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo&#39;s Intern compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers housing assistance, $35 - $44 per hour (compensation is determined based on education, skills, and experience), 1-on-1 mentorship, hands-on training, and the opportunity to engage in fun team-building activities as well as interactive workshops, enhancing both professional and personal growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Due to the nature of Oklo&#39;s work, only U.S. citizens can be considered for these positions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! &amp;nbsp;We are excited to announce a General Open Call for Applications, open to all applicants who possess a passion for excellence and a drive to make a positive impact. We are searching for exceptional individuals who can bring diverse perspectives and talents to our organization. To apply, please submit your resume and a cover letter to the provided email address or through our online application portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NOTE: Due to the nature of this open call, not all positions may be available immediately. However, we will regularly review applications and reach out to qualified individuals as suitable opportunities arise. Your application will be carefully considered for future roles that align with your skills and aspirations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for people who are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Eager to work on a dynamic team, receive constructive feedback, and grow with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving, while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is a clear, efficient, and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;While specific experience is not a mandatory requirement, a demonstrated track record of excellence in any field will be highly regarded. Tell us how you want to contribute to our team and mission!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;We encourage candidates from all backgrounds and experience levels to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oklo offers competitive compensation packages. Compensation is generally based on the candidates experience level and expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, competitive pay, 401k, health insurance, FSA, flexible work hours, and other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a &lt;strong&gt;Junior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Office Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Groves-based team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Junior Office Manager supports day-to-day operations at the Groves workplace, enabling the visitor experience, as well as helping keep the office organized, functional, secure, and welcoming. Working closely with Facility Launch &amp;amp; Operations Support, this role assists with visitor experiences and logistics, supplies, onboarding, vendor visits, and other routine workplace needs so employees can focus on their work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Junior Office Manager also provides onsite support for office and facility requests. This role helps document requests, coordinate schedules and access, share updates, and follow up on assigned tasks. Facility Launch &amp;amp; Operations Support and the appropriate functional owners guide facility projects, specialized work, approvals, and decisions outside the scope of this junior role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Junior Office Manager will partner closely with Oklo’s Business Operations, People, Media and Comms, IT, Finance, Security, and Environmental Health and Safety teams to support consistent company-wide processes at the Groves location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front Office &amp;amp; Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome visitors and coordinate site access in accordance with Oklo’s security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage incoming and outgoing mail, shipping, office communications, and shared workplace information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to routine office requests and direct questions that need specialized support to the appropriate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the workplace portions of employee onboarding and offboarding, including workspaces, equipment, badges, and office orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in efforts to support and improve the facility experience for visitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the facility’s educational elements through the lens of graphic design and human factors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists with onsite logistics for meetings, employee events, workplace activities, and site tours, including scheduling, visitor communications, space setup, refreshments, access coordination, and day-of support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a welcoming, inclusive, and productive workplace experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities &amp;amp; Vendor Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help keep office and common areas organized, functional, and ready for use by checking spaces regularly and reporting issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Facility Launch &amp;amp; Operations Support with vendor visits by gathering quotes, organizing invoices for review, and following up on routine service requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Log maintenance needs involving HVAC, electrical, plumbing, janitorial service, furniture, equipment, access controls, and other building services, then route them to the appropriate team or provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help collect scopes of work and required approvals, arrange site access once work is approved, and keep records of maintenance, inspections, and repairs up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with routine onsite tasks, such as basic furniture moves and equipment checks. Help with cable connections or device restarts only when authorized and directed by the responsible team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support larger office improvements and equipment installations by preparing spaces, helping vendors access the site, and sharing schedule updates with affected employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Facilitation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Facility Launch &amp;amp; Operations Support by helping connect onsite and remote employees, service providers, and the appropriate Oklo teams during facility-related work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide basic onsite assistance under the direction of the responsible team when work requires specialized expertise or approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain records of ongoing work, including the request, owner, required approvals, schedule, and current status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share approved schedules, outages, access restrictions, safety requirements, and project updates with affected employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up on assigned requests and promptly flag delays, unclear ownership, unexpected conditions, or safety concerns to Facility Launch &amp;amp; Operations Support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Route proposed work affecting specialized spaces, building systems, equipment, or IT infrastructure to the appropriate Oklo team for review before work begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplies &amp;amp; Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order and maintain office, kitchen, conference-room, and other general workplace supplies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track office equipment, furniture, keys, badges, and workplace assets in partnership with the appropriate Oklo teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the delivery, placement, inventory, and return of general workplace and technology equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve vendor service, purchasing, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance, Safety &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help prepare purchase requests and invoices for review, keep basic office expense records, and gather receipts for assigned corporate-card transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized facility, vendor, purchasing, and workplace records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support local safety, security, inspections, and emergency-preparedness activities in partnership with the appropriate Oklo teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate facility, safety, or security concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environmental Health and Safety&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Oklo’s EHS team with onsite postings, records, inspections, emergency preparedness, and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate EHS guidance, access restrictions, and facility updates to employees, visitors, vendors, and contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and promptly escalate safety, security, or facility concerns to EHS and the appropriate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate required approvals before work begins in specialized spaces or on building systems, equipment, or IT infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent; associate’s or bachelor’s degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0–2 years of experience in office administration, reception, customer service, or a related support role; relevant school or volunteer experience is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with email, calendars, documents, and spreadsheets, including Microsoft Office or Google Workspace; ability to learn new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize requests, follow through, and ask for guidance when a task needs approval or specialized expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work onsite at the Groves location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift or move 25lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Junior Office Manager who is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organized and dependable:&lt;/strong&gt; Manages multiple priorities and follows tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive and resourceful:&lt;/strong&gt; Anticipates needs, identifies problems early, and develops practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service-oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; Creates a welcoming, functional, and productive workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety- and security-conscious:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently follows visitor, access, confidentiality, and workplace safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Can compare quotes, coordinate services, review invoices, and monitor vendor performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicates clearly and professionally with employees, visitors, vendors, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; Remains effective as priorities and workplace needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process-minded:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds practical systems that improve consistency and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discreet and trustworthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Handles sensitive information with sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable working independently:&lt;/strong&gt; Takes ownership while knowing when to involve the appropriate internal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hourly: $28-$40/hourly&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may involve access to information subject to U.S. export control laws. Only applicants who meet the definition of a U.S. person under applicable laws may be eligible.&lt;/p&gt;
