&lt;div class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo!&amp;nbsp; We are searching for an Instrumentation and Controls Engineer to join our engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;201&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Position Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Instrumentation and Controls Engineer is responsible for developing, analyzing, and integrating measurement and control systems to support reactor operation.&amp;nbsp;This position may reside within powerhouse engineering supporting power generation or within the isotopes organization supporting isotope reactors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;407&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design instrumentation and control systems that integrate sensors, instrumentation, actuators, and other control components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical execution of assigned systems as a responsible engineer that coordinates requirements, design, testing, and commissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop control strategies and algorithms for industrial equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our engineering team in integrating and coupling engineering analyses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical feedback to quick-iterating design teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document work using modern tools and techniques, and write well-written, thoughtful technical reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3994&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience specifying, designing, and integrating instrumentation that spans temperature, pressure, radiation, neutron instrumentation, and other process measurement technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with measurement techniques, signal conditioning, data acquisition, and logic diagrams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing system and component level requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing control strategies and automating industrial equipment and processes&lt;/li&gt;
