&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2336&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A startup person:&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process.&amp;nbsp; You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team.&amp;nbsp; If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us!&amp;nbsp; There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
