&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mechatronics Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our nuclear fuel recycling engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;mechatronics engineer &lt;/strong&gt;is responsible for designing &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;automated systems and robotic material-handling equipment&lt;/strong&gt; for remote-operated processes in radiological hot cells for the Oklo Fuel Recycling Facility. Day-to-day activities will include system design, CAD modeling, requirements generation, and eventual prototyping and integration of augmentation into various systems. This role involves close collaboration with cross-functional teams including facility design, chemical engineering, pyroprocessing, instrumentation and controls, software engineering, process modeling, quality assurance, and licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is a strong preference for candidates in the Oak Ridge, TN area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Designing robotic and electromechanical systems for remote handling of materials in high-temperature, high corrosion, and high-radiation environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Defining architecture, specifications, control logic, and performance criteria for automated material-handling and process systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Integrating automation hardware, sensors, and control systems for reliable unmanned operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Serving as technical lead for automation and handling systems across their lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Developing documentation to guide fabrication, installation, commissioning, operation, and maintenance of automated equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Generating technical documentation for regulatory filings and internal knowledge capture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Building, testing, and iterating on prototypes for automation and handling subsystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fe0640a33b5&quot;&gt;Writing clear, concise reports and communicating results across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering education in mechatronics, mechanical engineering, robotics, electrical engineering, or related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 10 years’ experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;automation or robotic system design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PLCs, industrial automation, and robotics programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency with CAD software, preferably Solidworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad familiarity with engineering principles and strong systems integration intuition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience with robotic arms, conveyors, or other automated handling systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience designing for remote or hazardous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience with radiological hot cell environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience with high-temperature (&amp;gt;500 °C) equipment design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Knowledge of GD&amp;amp;T and design for manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience with simulation tools (e.g., ANSYS, ROS, MATLAB/Simulink)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Background in nuclear, petrochemical, or pharmaceutical industries with automated systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Experience deploying or working on pilot plants or unmanned manufacturing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3023&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7119dbc12dbd&quot;&gt;Located by Oak Ridge, TN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2057&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mechatronics Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy and advanced fission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Proficient in 2D/3D modeling and CAD for mechanical and robotic systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Experienced with electromechanical systems, controls, and automation integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Energized by prototyping and deploying real-world hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Creative and persistent when tackling novel engineering challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;A strong communicator, both in technical writing and in collaborative discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;$100,000–$195,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be determined on a number of factors, including but not limited to years of experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5408&quot;&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, competitive pay, 401k, health insurance, FSA, flexible work hours, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5535&quot;&gt;We are looking to fill this position immediately!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for an &lt;strong&gt;Office Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Idaho Falls-based radioisotopes team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office Manager serves as the operational hub for the Idaho Falls workplace, ensuring the office and facility remain organized, functional, secure, and welcoming. This role coordinates workplace services, vendors, supplies, site access, employee onboarding and visitor logistics, and day-to-day facility needs so employees can remain focused on their work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office Manager also serves as the onsite coordination point for facility-related requests and activities. This role will maintain visibility across ongoing work, connect internal teams and external service providers, document ownership and dependencies, and track requests through completion. Decisions requiring specialized technical expertise will remain with the appropriate Oklo functional owners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office &amp;amp; Facilities Manager will partner closely with Oklo’s Business Operations, People, IT, Finance, Security, and Environmental Health and Safety teams to support consistent company-wide processes at the Idaho Falls location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front Office &amp;amp; Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome visitors and coordinate site access in accordance with Oklo’s security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage incoming and outgoing mail, shipping, office communications, and shared workplace information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for day-to-day office and facility needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the workplace portions of employee onboarding and offboarding, including workspaces, equipment, badges, and office orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate onsite logistics for meetings, employee events, workplace activities, and site tours, including scheduling, visitor communications, space setup, refreshments, access coordination, and day-of support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a welcoming, inclusive, and productive workplace experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities &amp;amp; Vendor Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the functionality, organization, and upkeep of office and common areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with landlords, cleaners, maintenance providers, and other vendors, including obtaining quotes, processing invoices, and monitoring service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate preventive and corrective maintenance for HVAC, electrical, plumbing, janitorial, furniture, equipment, access-control systems, and other general building services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain quotes, confirm scopes of work, facility required approvals, schedule site access, and track maintenance, inspections, repairs, and facility-related requests through completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform routine onsite tasks, including equipment inspections, basic furniture moves, approved cable connections, and authorized device restarts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate larger office improvements, equipment installations, cabling work, and other facility projects while minimizing disruption to employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Facilitation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the onsite coordination point for facility-related activities, connecting in-person and remote employees, external service providers, and the appropriate Oklo teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and provide basic hands-on support for onsite work under the direction of the responsible technical or functional owner when specialized expertise or approval is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility into ongoing facility work by documenting scope, ownership, dependencies, approvals, timelines, and status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate schedules, outages, access restrictions, safety requirements, and project updates to affected employees and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track requests through completion and promptly escalate delays, unclear ownership, unexpected conditions, or safety concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure work affecting specialized spaces, building systems, equipment, or IT infrastructure is reviewed by the appropriate Oklo teams before it begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplies &amp;amp; Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order and maintain office, kitchen, conference-room, and other general workplace supplies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track office equipment, furniture, keys, badges, and workplace assets in partnership with the appropriate Oklo teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the delivery, placement, inventory, and return of general workplace and technology equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve vendor service, purchasing, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance, Safety &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process purchase orders and invoices, track office expenses, and reconcile assigned corporate-card transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized facility, vendor, purchasing, and workplace records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support local safety, security, inspections, and emergency-preparedness activities in partnership with the appropriate Oklo teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and escalate facility, safety, or security concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent; associate’s or bachelor’s degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of relevant office management, facilities coordination, or workplace operations experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating vendors, maintenance, purchasing, and workplace logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience tracking cross-functional requests, projects, or work activities through completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office, Google Workspace, Slack and the ability to learn new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work onsite at the Idaho Falls location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting engineering, research, laboratory, manufacturing, or other technical teams is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift or move 25lbs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Office Manager who is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organized and dependable:&lt;/strong&gt; Manages multiple priorities and follows tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive and resourceful:&lt;/strong&gt; Anticipates needs, identifies problems early, and develops practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service-oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; Creates a welcoming, functional, and productive workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety- and security-conscious:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently follows visitor, access, confidentiality, and workplace safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Can compare quotes, coordinate services, review invoices, and monitor vendor performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicates clearly and professionally with employees, visitors, vendors, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; Remains effective as priorities and workplace needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process-minded:&lt;/strong&gt; Builds practical systems that improve consistency and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discreet and trustworthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Handles sensitive information with sound judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable working independently:&lt;/strong&gt; Takes ownership while knowing when to involve the appropriate internal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
