&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for engineers that are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Eager to work on a dynamic team, receive constructive feedback, and grow with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving, while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;;&quot;&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have experience and expertise in engineering, apply!&amp;nbsp; We also think the following are good indicators of qualifications to do this job: Bachelors, Masters, or PhD in an engineering field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo travel requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo requires remote employees to travel to headquarters (Santa Clara, CA) twice a quarter annually, based on business or team needs, including attendance at team meetings, off-sites, and other company events or gatherings. For the first two weeks of onboarding, employees are required to be in person at headquarters in Santa Clara, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $60,000-$180,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary may fall outside of the range provided and will be dependent on applicant experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, competitive pay, 401k, health insurance, FSA, flexible work hours, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;@oklo.com&lt;/span&gt; email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks for your interest in Oklo! We are searching for a Piping Designer / Drafter to join our Fuel Recycling Engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;153&quot; data-local-id=&quot;670c002a8472&quot;&gt;The person in this role is responsible for developing and maintaining the engineering drawings that define Oklo&#39;s first-of-a-kind (FOAK) nuclear fuel recycling facility. This includes creation and maintenance of Piping &amp;amp; Instrumentation Diagrams (P&amp;amp;IDs), piping layouts, equipment arrangement drawings, fabrication drawings, and other engineering documentation supporting the design, construction, and operation of the facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;583&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7627c1dd3db3&quot;&gt;This role will work closely with process, mechanical, electrical, controls, and systems engineers to translate engineering concepts into accurate, controlled engineering drawings that support design reviews, procurement, fabrication, construction, commissioning, and licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;862&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a33759f07437&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate enjoys building clean, organized drawing packages, identifying inconsistencies across disciplines, and helping engineering teams efficiently communicate complex systems through high-quality documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1130&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bca08fd21816&quot;&gt;Develop, revise, and maintain Piping/Process/Ventillation &amp;amp; Instrumentation Diagrams (P&amp;amp;IDs) using AutoCAD, AutoCAD Plant3D or equivalent CAD software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1285&quot; data-local-id=&quot;938553c49a31&quot;&gt;Produce piping layout drawings, equipment arrangement drawings, piping and equipment isometrics, and general arrangement drawings for process facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6cd359d022f6&quot;&gt;Coordinate closely with process, mechanical, electrical, instrumentation &amp;amp; controls, structural, and nuclear engineers to ensure drawing consistency across disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1614&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d12724b6b8a&quot;&gt;Incorporate engineering changes into controlled drawing packages while maintaining revision history and configuration management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1747&quot; data-local-id=&quot;37217de29e2d&quot;&gt;Assist with development of drawing standards, CAD libraries, drafting procedures, and document templates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1856&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c6ee5c09576&quot;&gt;Perform drawing quality checks to identify inconsistencies, clashes, missing information, and opportunities for design improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1991&quot; data-local-id=&quot;417b8aa6d64e&quot;&gt;Generate engineering documentation including bills of materials, equipment lists, line lists, and drawing packages supporting procurement and construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2150&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27d4574f564e&quot;&gt;Interface with fabricators, vendors, and construction teams to clarify drawings and incorporate field feedback into design revisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2287&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93803175a73c&quot;&gt;Help establish efficient drafting workflows that support rapid design iteration within a multidisciplinary engineering environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3837&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0949c7d50b91&quot;&gt;Associate&#39;s degree, technical certification, or Bachelor&#39;s degree in Drafting, Design Technology, Mechanical Engineering Technology, or a related field (or equivalent professional experience).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4033&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7aa2f2cc2d04&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience producing engineering drawings for industrial facilities or process equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4138&quot; data-local-id=&quot;311287d4e6e8&quot;&gt;Proficiency with AutoCAD or equivalent drafting software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4199&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f40b33f741a7&quot;&gt;Experience developing and maintaining Piping &amp;amp; Instrumentation Diagrams (P&amp;amp;IDs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4283&quot; data-local-id=&quot;861d9e4cf336&quot;&gt;Experience producing piping layouts, equipment arrangement drawings, and construction drawing packages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4390&quot; data-local-id=&quot;384bdfd4ff3a&quot;&gt;Understanding of industrial piping systems, valves, instrumentation, and process equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4485&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91e3f96f3e8f&quot;&gt;Familiarity with engineering drawing standards, revision control, and document management practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4589&quot; data-local-id=&quot;de63c3b87292&quot;&gt;Ability to read and interpret engineering specifications and collaborate effectively with multidisciplinary engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4744&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bac81707ffe0&quot;&gt;Experience with SolidWorks or similar 3D CAD software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4744&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bac81707ffe0&quot;&gt;Experience creating piping assemblies, equipment layouts, or plant models in 3D CAD environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4903&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbc1d2281ef3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with process plant design in nuclear, chemical, petrochemical, mining, pharmaceutical, or power generation industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5037&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f471f4f90800&quot;&gt;Experience supporting facility design from conceptual design through detailed engineering and construction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5148&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43a22c3b453a&quot;&gt;Familiarity with piping codes and standards such as ASME B31.1, ASME B31.3, or equivalent industrial standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5263&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bf1ec5934162&quot;&gt;Experience using PDM/PLM systems and engineering document control systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5341&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3455ee81dd94&quot;&gt;Knowledge of instrumentation symbols, ISA standards, and process control documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5432&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a02416196b9e&quot;&gt;Experience supporting multidisciplinary design reviews, HAZOPs, or constructability reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c7305bd8abb6&quot;&gt;Experience with commercial or governmental nuclear projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5592&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c42fabf3a2fd&quot;&gt;Experience working in highly regulated industries with strong quality assurance and configuration management requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2439&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f60afbc75ea5&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Piping Designer / Drafter that is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a9dfefe5-e758-4572-ae51-74c526056d63&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2498&quot; data-local-id=&quot;431d37520458&quot;&gt;Passionate about clean energy and closing the nuclear fuel cycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2567&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fcac309178f4&quot;&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, producing accurate, professional engineering drawings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;631ae149d3f6&quot;&gt;Proficient in AutoCAD or similar 2D drafting software for industrial facility design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2752&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b4a5c718d0e6&quot;&gt;Experienced with piping and process documentation including P&amp;amp;IDs, piping layouts, equipment arrangements, and construction drawing packages for industrial facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2924&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c034d9b5b934&quot;&gt;Comfortable working from incomplete information and collaborating with engineers to develop evolving designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3037&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1457263412f8&quot;&gt;Able to identify drawing inconsistencies and improve documentation quality before release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3131&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a67921f3050d&quot;&gt;Excited to work on first-of-a-kind industrial facilities where designs evolve rapidly through prototyping and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3253&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f8233676fdc9&quot;&gt;Comfortable working across multiple engineering disciplines and balancing competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cee9f90a231d&quot;&gt;An optimist at heart, comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3444&quot; data-local-id=&quot;febf6aa5ebe1&quot;&gt;An excellent communicator who can work effectively with engineers, fabricators, vendors, and project stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Level:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;21ff97486296&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3583&quot; data-local-id=&quot;899b18bc01f9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experienced (5+ years)&lt;/strong&gt;: Candidates should have demonstrated experience producing engineering drawings for industrial process facilities, manufacturing systems, power generation, chemical processing, or related industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
