&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Chemical or Electrical Engineering or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in process controls engineering or similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
